cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this skill pack, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "rseng-agent-skills: research software engineering skills for AI coding agents"
abstract: >-
  A research software engineering skills pack for AI coding agents
  (Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI): 67
  skills covering research software practice, with workflow commands,
  subagents and a phased practice-enforcement layer. Most skills are
  hand-authored against verified primary references; a minority are
  generated from two pinned CC-BY-4.0 community sources (RSQKit by the
  EVERSE project, and the Netherlands eScience Center Software
  Development Guide) by a reproducible pipeline that stamps per-source
  provenance.
authors:
  - family-names: Diblen
    given-names: Faruk
    email: faruk.diblen@resoftlabs.com
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/fdiblen/rseng-agent-skills
keywords:
  - research software
  - research software engineering
  - software quality
  - AI coding agents
  - agent skills
  - FAIR software
  - RSQKit
  - EVERSE
version: 0.1.0
